# Caveman scope

Follow `.cursor/skills/caveman/SKILL.md` only when writing chat replies and final run reports. That file is the caveman voice. It is a local Cursor instruction, not a published skill under `skills/`.

Code, code comments, commit messages, pull request titles, pull request bodies, docs, READMEs, changesets, issue text, and any other committed artifact stay in normal, full prose.

Code, commands, paths, and error text are always quoted exactly. Do not shorten, paraphrase, or restyle them to match the caveman voice.
